Art Assets — OSS Signal "Modern Calibration"

No image assets ship with the project. The hero uses an inline SVG circuit-board
graphic (defined in src/components/hero-section.tsx) drawn with CSS palette tokens
(--color-accent / --color-text-muted) so it follows light/dark theme.

Historical: the previous "Renaissance Edition" used hero-sky.webp, a Public Domain
reproduction of Turner's "The Fighting Temeraire" (1839, National Gallery NG524).
Deleted 2026-08-04 as part of the Modern Calibration reskin (decisions.md #57-66).
